Test Adapter for TAEF
=====================

Test Adapter for TAEF is a modified version of Google Test Adapter
(https://github.com/csoltenborn/GoogleTestAdapter):

    Google Test Adapter
    Copyright 2015-2019 Christian Soltenborn and contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Google Test Adapter has been converted into a Visual Studio 2026/2022 test adapter for
native test DLLs of the Test Authoring and Execution Framework (TAEF). Any file taken
from Google Test Adapter may have been changed; see LICENSE.md (LICENSE.txt in the VSIX and
the NuGet package) for the license and the notice of modification, which applies to all of
these files. In addition, most changed C# source files carry the note "This file has been
modified for TAEF support.", and source files that were modified by Microsoft as part of
Google Test Adapter carry a notice to that effect.


