Third-party components
----------------------

The binary packages of the Test Adapter for TAEF contain the following third-party
component:

1. msdia140.dll of the Microsoft Debug Interface Access (DIA) SDK (VSIX and NuGet
   package), which is part of Visual Studio and is subject to the Visual Studio license
   terms (https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/license-terms/).

TAEF itself (TE.exe, its runtime, headers and libraries) is not part of the Test Adapter
for TAEF; it is provided by the Windows Kits (e.g. the Windows Driver Kit) or by the
Microsoft.Taef NuGet package under their own license terms.
